    <item>
      <title>1 Byte Changed Evading Antivirus</title>
      <link>https://0xrahuexec.github.io/kh/posts/1-byte-changed-evading-antivirus/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 13:30:00 +0700</pubDate>
      <guid>https://0xrahuexec.github.io/kh/posts/1-byte-changed-evading-antivirus/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h4 id=&#34;1-byte-evading&#34;&gt;1 Byte Evading&lt;a href=&#34;#1-byte-evading&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Link to this section&#34;&gt;&lt;svg class=&#34;h-4 w-4&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34;&gt;&lt;g fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71&#34;/&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71&#34;/&gt;&lt;/g&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;ដំបូងយើងត្រូវបង្កើត Shell Code ជាប្រភេទភាសារ C នៅក្នុង Cobalt Strike ដូចរូបខាងក្រោម៖&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure&#xA;  class=&#34;image-figure not-prose my-8&#34;&#xA;  data-lightbox-enabled=&#34;&#xA;    true&#xA;  &#34;&#xA;  data-gallery-type=&#34;auto&#34;&#xA;  data-image-width=&#34;771&#34;&#xA;  data-image-height=&#34;651&#34;&#xA;  data-image-src=&#34;https://0xrahuexec.github.io/kh/posts/1-byte-changed-evading-antivirus/c-shellcode.kh.jpg&#34;&#xA;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;image-container&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img&#xA;    src=&#34;https://0xrahuexec.github.io/kh/posts/1-byte-changed-evading-antivirus/c-shellcode.kh.jpg&#34;&#xA;    alt=&#34;c-shellcode&#34;&#xA;    &#xA;    &#xA;      &#xA;      &#xA;        &#xA;          width=&#34;771&#34; height=&#34;651&#34;&#xA;        &#xA;      &#xA;    &#xA;    loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&#xA;    decoding=&#34;async&#34;&#xA;    data-gallery-src=&#34;https://0xrahuexec.github.io/kh/posts/1-byte-changed-evading-antivirus/c-shellcode.kh.jpg&#34;&#xA;    data-gallery-alt=&#34;c-shellcode&#34;&#xA;    data-gallery-title=&#34;&#34;&#xA;  /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;  &lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;សូមចាប់អារម្មណ៏ត្រង់ Byte ដំបូងគេនៃ Code គឺ &lt;span style=&#34;color:grey&#34;&gt;\xfc&lt;/span&gt; ។&#xA;តស់!!! មកកែប្រែចំនួន Byte ដូចខាងក្រោម៖&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul style=&#34;list-style-type:square&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li&gt;ប្ដូរ &lt;span style=&#34;color:grey&#34;&gt;\xfc&lt;/span&gt; ទៅជាចំនួនតម្លៃ Byte ផ្សេង។ ឧ. &lt;span style=&#34;color:grey&#34;&gt;\xfd, \x3a, \x6f\&lt;/span&gt; ។ល។&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li&gt;រក្សាតម្លៃដើមដែលត្រឹមត្រូវនៅក្នុង Char Variable =&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:grey&#34;&gt;char first[] = &#34;&lt;span style=&#34;color:red&#34;&gt;\xfc&lt;/span&gt;&#34;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li&gt;Build ឯកសារ exe ជាមួយកម្មវិធីអានកូដជាការស្រេច។&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;ខាងក្រោមជា Source Code សម្រាប់អ្នកដែលចង់សាកល្បងវិធីសាស្ត្រមួយនេះ៕&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>[Zrok] - CobaltStrike Over WAN Connection</title>
      <link>https://0xrahuexec.github.io/kh/posts/zrok-cobaltstrike-over-wan-connection/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 19:30:00 +0800</pubDate>
      <guid>https://0xrahuexec.github.io/kh/posts/zrok-cobaltstrike-over-wan-connection/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;ខាងក្រោមនេះជាគំនិតផ្ទាល់ខ្លួនមួយប្រភេទផ្សេងទៀតក្នុងការតភ្ជាប់ Teamserver និងប្រើប្រាស់ Beacons ពីចំងាយតាមរយៈ Zrok ។&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h4 id=&#34;requirements&#34;&gt;Requirements&lt;a href=&#34;#requirements&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Link to this section&#34;&gt;&lt;svg class=&#34;h-4 w-4&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34;&gt;&lt;g fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71&#34;/&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71&#34;/&gt;&lt;/g&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;CobaltStrike&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Email&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Zrok&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Telebit&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h4 id=&#34;zrok-setup&#34;&gt;Zrok Setup&lt;a href=&#34;#zrok-setup&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Link to this section&#34;&gt;&lt;svg class=&#34;h-4 w-4&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34;&gt;&lt;g fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71&#34;/&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71&#34;/&gt;&lt;/g&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;ចូលទៅតំណភ្ជាប់នេះ &lt;a&#xA;    href=&#34;https://docs.zrok.io/docs/getting-started/&#34;target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xA;    class=&#34;inline-flex items-center gap-1&#34;&#xA;  &gt;https://docs.zrok.io/docs/getting-started/&lt;svg class=&#34;h-3 w-3 flex-shrink-0&#34; id=&#34;external-link&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34;&gt;&lt;path fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; d=&#34;M15 3h6v6m-11 5L21 3m-3 10v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt; បន្ទាប់មកសូមទាញយកកម្មវិធីឲ្យត្រូវទៅតាមប្រភេទនៃម៉ាស៊ីនមេរបស់អ្នក ក្នុងនៃនេះខ្ញុំនឹងយកប្រភេទ Linux ធ្វើជាម៉ាស៊ីនមេ ។&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>CobaltStrike Over WAN Connection</title>
      <link>https://0xrahuexec.github.io/kh/posts/cobaltstrike-over-wan-connection/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 19:30:00 +0800</pubDate>
      <guid>https://0xrahuexec.github.io/kh/posts/cobaltstrike-over-wan-connection/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;ខាងក្រោមនេះជាគំនិតផ្ទាល់ខ្លួនក្នុងការតភ្ជាប់ Teamserver និងប្រើប្រាស់ពាក្យបញ្ជាតាមរយៈ Beacons ពីចំងាយដោយមិនចាំបាច់បើក Port Forwarding ។&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h4 id=&#34;requirements&#34;&gt;Requirements&lt;a href=&#34;#requirements&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Link to this section&#34;&gt;&lt;svg class=&#34;h-4 w-4&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34;&gt;&lt;g fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71&#34;/&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71&#34;/&gt;&lt;/g&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;CobaltStrike&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Telebit&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h4 id=&#34;telebit-setup&#34;&gt;Telebit Setup&lt;a href=&#34;#telebit-setup&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Link to this section&#34;&gt;&lt;svg class=&#34;h-4 w-4&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34;&gt;&lt;g fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71&#34;/&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71&#34;/&gt;&lt;/g&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;ចំណាំ៖&lt;/b&gt; ចូលទៅកាន់ &lt;a&#xA;    href=&#34;https://telebit.cloud&#34;target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xA;    class=&#34;inline-flex items-center gap-1&#34;&#xA;  &gt;telebit.cloud&lt;svg class=&#34;h-3 w-3 flex-shrink-0&#34; id=&#34;external-link&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34;&gt;&lt;path fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; d=&#34;M15 3h6v6m-11 5L21 3m-3 10v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt; ដើម្បីយល់ដឹងបន្ថែមអំពី Configuration ។&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
